## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 FlashX
- **Short description:** Z.ai's high-speed serving variant of GLM-5.3-Flash with identical weights at ~200 tok/s for low-latency multimodal agentic coding.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai / Z.ai API Platform (No Zen Free ID)
- **Release / knowledge:** September 2026; knowledge cutoff May 2026
- **IDs:** `zai/glm-5.3-flashx`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) context window / 128,000 (128K) max output
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calls; JSON mode
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-08):** Paid $0.37 input / $1.25 output per 1M tokens (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture

